usage: step5_sparsification.py [-h] --experiment-dir EXPERIMENT_DIR
                               [--similarity-dir SIMILARITY_DIR]
                               [--suffix SUFFIX]

Sparsify similarity matrix with KNN graph.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --experiment-dir EXPERIMENT_DIR
                        Experiment directory path
  --similarity-dir SIMILARITY_DIR
                        Directory containing similarity_matrices*.npz
  --suffix SUFFIX       Run suffix for output naming (general, m2, m6, m10)
